WEBVTT

00:24.600 --> 00:25.440
Master.

00:31.560 --> 00:32.560
Master,

00:32.640 --> 00:34.560
we came here at the agreed time.

00:34.640 --> 00:36.160
But he suddenly changed his mind.

00:36.240 --> 00:37.600
He won't let us take the deceased.

00:37.680 --> 00:38.840
Look at him.

00:47.880 --> 00:48.840
Hello.

00:49.760 --> 00:51.600
We are with the funeral parlor.

00:51.680 --> 00:54.320
How may I help you?

00:54.880 --> 00:56.120
Stop rushing me.

00:56.200 --> 00:57.560
I have told you already.

00:57.640 --> 01:00.920
You can take my dad when the hour comes.

01:02.880 --> 01:06.000
What exact hour do you mean?

01:06.080 --> 01:07.720
Not now anyway.

01:08.800 --> 01:10.360
My dad hasn't departed yet.

01:11.320 --> 01:13.080
He still has something to say to me.

01:18.040 --> 01:19.760
You must think

01:20.480 --> 01:22.960
I'm out of my mind, right?

01:30.960 --> 01:32.760
You are perfectly all right.

01:33.440 --> 01:34.720
If I'm not mistaken,

01:34.800 --> 01:36.360
your family has many customs to follow.

01:37.320 --> 01:38.840
You are just

01:38.920 --> 01:40.720
following your dad's last wishes.

01:43.800 --> 01:45.480
I have heard before

01:46.160 --> 01:47.240
that if the deceased person

01:47.320 --> 01:48.480
is reflected in a mirror

01:48.560 --> 01:49.960
or any reflective object,

01:50.040 --> 01:51.640
they won't rest in peace.

01:52.320 --> 01:53.320
So they must be covered.

01:56.040 --> 01:57.280
Do you know this?

02:00.000 --> 02:01.320
We will try our best to understand

02:01.400 --> 02:03.320
and respect the traditions of each family.

02:04.280 --> 02:06.080
I believe your dad told you

02:06.640 --> 02:07.840
not to cry

02:07.920 --> 02:09.039
after his passing.

02:13.360 --> 02:14.400
He said

02:14.920 --> 02:16.240
there is a process

02:17.040 --> 02:18.640
when the consciousness leaves the body.

02:19.800 --> 02:22.560
So I don't want to disturb him.

02:30.160 --> 02:31.520
After this,

02:32.440 --> 02:34.280
it's truly considered his departure.

02:36.360 --> 02:37.320
All right, then.

02:38.320 --> 02:39.840
We will wait with you.

03:03.320 --> 03:04.160
I need their help.

03:04.240 --> 03:05.880
On the count of three, open the curtains.

03:05.960 --> 03:07.160
Be fast, okay?

03:10.120 --> 03:11.320
One,

03:12.800 --> 03:14.160
two,

03:16.240 --> 03:17.120
three.

04:45.640 --> 04:50.400
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

04:53.480 --> 04:54.960
Dad, hurry up!

04:55.040 --> 04:56.880
My class rep doesn't like us to be late.

04:56.960 --> 04:57.800
One moment.

04:57.880 --> 04:59.680
I will send Yan first.
The train won't wait.

04:59.760 --> 05:00.880
Wait for a bit.

05:00.960 --> 05:02.160
He Zhangyue, don't pack that.

05:02.240 --> 05:03.080
It has additives.

05:03.160 --> 05:04.040
How did I not see it?

05:04.120 --> 05:05.680
Mr. He, did you say

05:05.760 --> 05:07.800
Yan Village's vegetable business was slow?

05:07.880 --> 05:08.880
Not anymore.

05:08.960 --> 05:10.600
The town has contacted
a supermarket chain.

05:10.680 --> 05:12.560
They purchase directly from the fields.

05:12.640 --> 05:15.280
He Zhangyue, did you wash Yan's sneakers?

05:15.360 --> 05:16.920
They are dry and downstairs.

05:17.000 --> 05:19.480
He Niaoniao, bring Yan's shoes up!

05:20.040 --> 05:21.200
Fine.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.600
Mr. He,

05:22.680 --> 05:24.440
when will the town's seaside resort open?

05:24.520 --> 05:25.960
I can help with publicity.

05:26.040 --> 05:26.880
Really?

05:26.960 --> 05:28.640
Zhuang Jie, you are annoying.

05:28.720 --> 05:31.400
Why keep interrupting us
when you are not in a hurry to leave?

05:31.480 --> 05:33.680
I want to do something for the town.

05:33.760 --> 05:34.600
Jie, no rush.

05:34.680 --> 05:36.520
-I'll find out about the resort.
-Dad, hurry up!

05:36.600 --> 05:37.440
Hurry up.

05:37.520 --> 05:39.160
I'm zipping up the case!

05:39.240 --> 05:40.480
There is more here.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.760
More?

05:42.280 --> 05:43.880
Mr. He, send Niaoniao first.

05:43.960 --> 05:44.840
Mom is here with me.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.000
I beg your pardon?

05:46.080 --> 05:47.840
You should have done this last night.

05:47.920 --> 05:50.240
It is always a mess before you leave home.

05:50.320 --> 05:51.320
-Right.
-Don't blame me.

05:51.400 --> 05:52.640
Your two daughters are annoying.

05:52.720 --> 05:54.280
Here. No rush. I'll drop her off first.

05:54.360 --> 05:56.920
-Dad, come down now!
-Don't bother with him. He can take a cab.

05:57.000 --> 05:57.840
I'm coming!

05:57.920 --> 05:59.920
We have to check out the factory later.

06:00.000 --> 06:02.240
Sign the contract soon.
There is a lot to do afterward.

06:02.320 --> 06:03.520
That has to be in the evening.

06:03.600 --> 06:04.720
I'm going to Yanggou Village

06:04.800 --> 06:06.240
to help load yams for transportation.

06:06.320 --> 06:07.240
You are so occupied.

06:07.320 --> 06:08.440
I bet the town

06:08.520 --> 06:09.880
will end up consuming the yams.

06:09.960 --> 06:11.480
They bit off more than they can chew.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.320
Are the yams not selling well?

06:13.400 --> 06:15.640
How large is the yield?
Who is in charge? Mr. He!

06:15.720 --> 06:16.640
We are leaving.

06:16.720 --> 06:18.400
-We'll talk later.
-Jie, keep my goose safe!

06:18.480 --> 06:20.400
-Just go already.
-My goose.

06:20.480 --> 06:22.480
Mom, where is Yanggou Village?

06:22.560 --> 06:24.120
Let's go there this afternoon.

06:24.200 --> 06:26.160
Mom?

06:26.240 --> 06:28.120
Shut your mouth. Stop calling me.

06:28.200 --> 06:29.720
Enough of the noise.

06:40.440 --> 06:41.600
Maidong.

06:42.080 --> 06:43.680
Maidong, are you home?

06:44.440 --> 06:45.880
Maidong?

06:45.960 --> 06:47.240
Are you home?

06:47.960 --> 06:50.120
I heard you were
on the night shift yesterday.

06:50.200 --> 06:52.080
Then you must know

06:52.160 --> 06:53.480
he needs to sleep.

06:54.160 --> 06:55.080
Mrs. Chen,

06:55.160 --> 06:57.480
the town is conducting a census,

06:57.560 --> 06:59.360
so I need
to confirm something with Maidong.

06:59.440 --> 07:00.640
Is Maidong inside?

07:00.720 --> 07:01.720
I will go in.

07:01.800 --> 07:02.960
He's not in.

07:03.040 --> 07:04.640
He ran out after taking a call.

07:04.720 --> 07:06.240
He didn't sleep a wink.

07:06.320 --> 07:08.240
I wonder what the urgent matter is.

07:10.800 --> 07:12.480
What bad timing.

07:12.560 --> 07:14.800
Well, if he's not in, I'll get going.

07:14.880 --> 07:16.960
Ask him to give me a call when he is back.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.040
Why the rush?

07:19.200 --> 07:20.600
I won't eat you.

07:22.640 --> 07:23.800
Come and have some tea.

07:27.120 --> 07:28.160
Mrs. Chen,

07:28.240 --> 07:30.000
I can't stay for tea today.

07:30.080 --> 07:32.040
I need to visit some other places.

07:32.120 --> 07:33.080
Don't pretend.

07:33.160 --> 07:35.200
I know you all are annoyed with me.

07:35.280 --> 07:37.200
You are all avoiding me.

07:39.400 --> 07:40.960
That's not true.

07:41.040 --> 07:43.440
Mrs. Chen, you're overthinking.

07:43.520 --> 07:45.920
You asked me to look for a girl
for Maidong,

07:46.000 --> 07:46.880
I didn't forget that.

07:46.960 --> 07:49.040
That's my job.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.000
Besides,

07:50.080 --> 07:51.800
the mayor is concerned about this too.

07:51.880 --> 07:53.000
So don't worry.

07:53.080 --> 07:54.800
I promise I will accomplish the task.

07:56.160 --> 07:58.520
Now I will offer another chance.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.120
What do you say?

08:00.200 --> 08:01.120
What is it?

08:01.200 --> 08:04.040
Can the town broadcast station
still read appreciation letters?

08:05.240 --> 08:06.240
I see.

08:07.440 --> 08:09.560
A few months ago,
they focused on legal education.

08:09.640 --> 08:10.760
-They brought back--
-Perfect.

08:10.840 --> 08:12.600
I will provide you with some material.

08:12.680 --> 08:17.280
YANGGOU VILLAGE

08:23.320 --> 08:24.400
It's heavy. Slow down.

08:24.480 --> 08:25.440
Be careful.

08:26.080 --> 08:27.240
Slowly.

08:28.480 --> 08:30.200
-Can your back handle this?
-Yes.

08:30.280 --> 08:32.640
-It's an old injury, so be careful.
-All right.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.039
Come.

08:36.640 --> 08:37.919
Slowly.

08:42.320 --> 08:43.240
Mr. Yang,

08:43.320 --> 08:44.520
how are these yams

08:44.600 --> 08:45.760
so well-preserved?

08:45.840 --> 08:47.520
We dig them up every autumn,

08:47.600 --> 08:49.400
but can't sell them all at once.

08:49.480 --> 08:51.800
So we came up
with a sand preservation method.

08:51.880 --> 08:54.240
A layer of yams
followed by a layer of fine sand,

08:54.320 --> 08:55.520
then sealed with soil on top.

08:55.600 --> 08:58.160
When spring comes,
we must think of a way to sell them.

08:58.240 --> 09:01.200
How come these high-quality yams
aren't selling?

09:01.280 --> 09:02.880
That's the point.

09:03.560 --> 09:04.640
As you know,

09:04.720 --> 09:06.680
Yanggou Village is quite remote.

09:06.760 --> 09:08.440
Also, we don't
have a distribution channel.

09:08.520 --> 09:10.400
It's a concern every year.

09:10.480 --> 09:12.200
There was a small factory
that always waited

09:12.280 --> 09:13.880
until the end of the procurement period.

09:13.960 --> 09:16.680
The more anxious we are,
the lower they drive the price.

09:16.760 --> 09:18.240
It's infuriating.

09:19.160 --> 09:20.200
Scoundrels.

09:20.960 --> 09:22.760
They are taking advantage of us.

09:23.520 --> 09:25.200
Mr. He, Mr. Yang.

09:26.440 --> 09:28.560
Leave the distribution channels to me.

09:28.640 --> 09:31.400
I promise
I will bring the price up this year.

09:31.480 --> 09:34.400
Soon, these small factories
will have to line up to buy.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.160
Did you hear that?

09:37.080 --> 09:39.200
Jie, we will count on you, then.

09:39.280 --> 09:41.080
I'll make shredded yams for you tonight.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.320
Come on, keep on.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.320
I'm motivated now.

09:45.400 --> 09:46.280
Come.

09:46.920 --> 09:48.320
Come. One, two.

09:48.400 --> 09:49.280
Be careful.

09:49.360 --> 09:50.320
Right, be careful.

09:51.160 --> 09:52.680
Perhaps I'm just inexperienced.

09:52.760 --> 09:55.040
The guy this morning was strange.

09:56.040 --> 09:57.160
He did have a lot of customs.

09:59.000 --> 10:00.560
Hey, Hai.

10:02.840 --> 10:04.960
What did you see this morning?

10:05.040 --> 10:06.160
Nothing.

10:07.240 --> 10:08.680
The sun was too bright.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.400
Nothing?

10:10.480 --> 10:12.320
Master, what did you see?

10:12.400 --> 10:14.000
Townsfolk, good afternoon.

10:14.560 --> 10:16.440
Attention.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.480
Open the window.

10:18.560 --> 10:20.120
Is it an announcement?

10:20.200 --> 10:22.040
…are all policies that benefit the people.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.680
Please pay attention to this.

10:23.760 --> 10:25.760
Just now, we mentioned…

10:27.240 --> 10:29.040
It has been tough for those villagers.

10:29.120 --> 10:30.240
If I were to handle that,

10:30.320 --> 10:31.200
I might lose money

10:31.280 --> 10:32.280
instead of making money.

10:32.360 --> 10:33.400
Impossible.

10:33.480 --> 10:35.320
-From what I know about you,
-All events…

10:35.400 --> 10:37.680
-you will succeed in everything you do.
-…are handled by professionals.

10:37.760 --> 10:39.960
Mr. He, you are flattering me too much.

10:40.040 --> 10:41.360
My mom would scold you.

10:41.440 --> 10:42.360
Actually, she probably

10:42.440 --> 10:43.640
-thinks the same deep inside.
-…can come see me at the committee.

10:47.120 --> 10:50.440
Next, we will revive a good tradition

10:50.520 --> 10:51.760
of reading appreciation letters.

10:54.360 --> 10:56.880
-This segment has always been…
-Mr. He, what is that?

10:56.960 --> 10:58.600
It's the town's village-wide broadcast.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.040
Villages miles away can hear it

11:01.120 --> 11:02.360
when the speaker plays.

11:02.440 --> 11:03.680
It's quite convenient.

11:03.760 --> 11:04.920
This is to Chen Maidong.

11:06.120 --> 11:07.280
Her letter says,

11:07.360 --> 11:08.600
"I'm the wife

11:08.680 --> 11:10.760
of a Chinese American man.

11:10.840 --> 11:11.960
This May,

11:12.040 --> 11:13.840
my husband suddenly passed away

11:13.920 --> 11:15.400
during a trip.

11:15.480 --> 11:18.080
It was Chen Maidong of your town

11:18.160 --> 11:21.760
who used his most professional skills
and greatest patience to explain to us."

11:21.840 --> 11:23.920
The town's meat processing plant
was an investment

11:24.000 --> 11:26.120
that the Wang family's second son got
from Beijing.

11:27.240 --> 11:29.080
Terraced fields
will be built on the hills.

11:29.640 --> 11:31.920
Yanggou Village has planted
tens of mus of yams.

11:32.000 --> 11:33.640
All of these were contributed

11:33.720 --> 11:35.400
by youngsters working in other provinces.

11:35.480 --> 11:37.680
Zhuang Jie, you came here
when you were a teen.

11:37.760 --> 11:39.320
I understand that you aren't attached.

11:39.400 --> 11:40.560
But that doesn't mean

11:40.640 --> 11:42.520
that everyone loves
to run their mouths like you.

11:42.600 --> 11:46.040
"He respects lives and is compassionate."

11:49.640 --> 11:50.640
Mom.

11:52.640 --> 11:53.560
My goodness!

11:53.640 --> 11:55.640
Why is your face sunburnt?

11:56.120 --> 11:57.040
It doesn't matter.

11:57.120 --> 11:59.160
Mom, I promise you,

11:59.240 --> 12:02.320
I'm going to use my sales skills
to help the town.

12:02.400 --> 12:04.120
You can depend on me

12:04.200 --> 12:05.400
to sell Yanggou Village's yams.

12:09.640 --> 12:11.200
"Thank you for grooming

12:11.280 --> 12:13.440
such a great civil servant.

12:13.520 --> 12:16.120
Besides, I appreciate your consideration
for the family

12:16.200 --> 12:18.320
and respect for life."

12:19.280 --> 12:20.200
All right.

12:22.240 --> 12:25.000
The final round of reading letters

12:25.080 --> 12:26.560
is now over.

12:28.320 --> 12:29.320
Grandma,

12:29.400 --> 12:31.800
why did the letter in my drawer
appear on the broadcast?

12:32.480 --> 12:33.720
Don't you feel embarrassed

12:34.280 --> 12:35.320
to force them

12:35.400 --> 12:36.640
to play one letter on a loop?

12:37.280 --> 12:38.920
I feel so ashamed.

12:41.160 --> 12:43.360
Wu, I'm leaving.

12:43.440 --> 12:46.320
Tomorrow, I will write you
a letter of appreciation.

12:46.400 --> 12:48.000
All right, rest early.

12:48.080 --> 12:49.640
Grandma,

12:49.720 --> 12:50.920
could you please stop all this?

12:51.000 --> 12:53.400
If you won't woo Jie,
I have to take matters into my own hands.

12:56.160 --> 12:58.480
I will take care of my own business.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.400
So, please.

13:00.480 --> 13:02.080
Stay out of it.

13:04.040 --> 13:06.080
"Returning from the Forbidden City
at dawn,

13:06.160 --> 13:08.560
leaving from the east gate
of Chang'an City in the dusk.

13:08.640 --> 13:10.680
I no longer speak of
what happened behind that gate.

13:10.760 --> 13:12.960
This journey ahead
is heading off to Jiangnan.

13:13.040 --> 13:15.520
The raised whip
urges the carriage forward,

13:15.600 --> 13:18.160
waving my loved ones and hometown off.

13:18.240 --> 13:20.440
I wasn't born belonging to any place,

13:22.000 --> 13:24.800
but I belong anywhere
my heart finds peace."

13:26.960 --> 13:28.440
I feel uneasy now.

13:28.520 --> 13:30.240
Don't ever do this again, Grandma.

13:30.320 --> 13:31.880
I don't always care about you.

13:31.960 --> 13:33.080
Just this time.

13:33.160 --> 13:34.240
The rest

13:34.320 --> 13:36.080
is up to you.

14:05.040 --> 14:06.280
So what if they're yams?

14:06.360 --> 14:08.280
Sales skills apply all the same.

14:08.360 --> 14:09.440
Aren't you from Nanping?

14:09.520 --> 14:10.720
You have to help out.

14:11.200 --> 14:13.800
Wang Xixia, have you
messaged the medicine supplier?

14:13.880 --> 14:15.520
Don't miss a single one.

14:18.480 --> 14:19.600
It's not that I'm pushing it.

14:19.680 --> 14:22.040
I just want to find more purchasers.

14:22.120 --> 14:24.960
Right. Get back to me
by tomorrow morning at the latest.

14:36.440 --> 14:37.360
Careful, it's hot.

14:37.440 --> 14:38.680
Thank you, Mr. He.

14:38.760 --> 14:41.920
Mr. Shen, the purchaser
you introduced to me isn't reliable.

14:42.000 --> 14:44.400
He straightaway demanded sand-grown yams.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.440
If I had that,

14:45.520 --> 14:47.040
I wouldn't have needed him.

14:47.120 --> 14:50.080
So I found a yam producer

14:50.160 --> 14:51.240
through a friend of mine.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.840
They requested a site inspection

14:52.920 --> 14:54.600
before making a decision.

14:54.680 --> 14:56.960
That's why I need another option.

14:57.040 --> 14:58.360
Please help me to ask around.

14:58.440 --> 15:00.600
I will treat you to a meal
when I'm back in Shanghai.

15:00.680 --> 15:03.160
Mom, can I not practice writing today?

15:03.240 --> 15:04.560
Jie is so noisy.

15:04.640 --> 15:06.440
Why don't you say
that she is full of energy?

15:06.520 --> 15:08.080
Of course, she is.

15:08.160 --> 15:10.120
She is trying to prove herself to someone.

15:10.200 --> 15:11.920
He Niaoniao, do you want a beating?

15:12.000 --> 15:13.120
I'm just guessing.

15:13.200 --> 15:14.280
Jie is smart.

15:14.360 --> 15:16.880
She will be on the broadcast
and prove herself to the entire town.

15:16.960 --> 15:17.800
The entire town?

15:17.880 --> 15:20.040
Not everyone is like you,

15:20.120 --> 15:21.520
always dreaming

15:21.600 --> 15:23.120
about being on TV

15:23.200 --> 15:25.440
or becoming a star.

15:25.520 --> 15:26.600
To be honest,

15:26.680 --> 15:28.240
if someone in the family were on TV,

15:28.320 --> 15:30.040
it would be Jie.

15:30.120 --> 15:31.480
Look at you. You are like a potato.

15:31.560 --> 15:32.440
Jie is the potato.

15:32.520 --> 15:33.840
Look at her face.

15:33.920 --> 15:34.880
It's peeling.

15:36.880 --> 15:37.960
Zhuang Jie.

15:38.040 --> 15:39.320
Gosh, your face.

15:39.400 --> 15:40.840
I'll try your grandma's method.

15:40.920 --> 15:42.120
I don't need that old remedy.

15:42.200 --> 15:44.320
I'll use some reparative facial masks.

15:44.400 --> 15:47.800
-Try this.
-Jie, don't waste Mom's love.

15:47.880 --> 15:49.760
What are you doing here?

15:49.840 --> 15:51.120
Let's both take a break.

15:51.200 --> 15:52.560
Rest up.

15:54.800 --> 15:55.640
Here.

15:59.280 --> 16:00.560
Gosh, He Zhangyue.

16:00.640 --> 16:03.040
Look at what you have done to my girl.

16:03.120 --> 16:05.360
Since she was little,
you have always taken her

16:05.440 --> 16:06.680
to the mountain or the river.

16:06.760 --> 16:08.640
She never comes home
looking like a fair girl.

16:08.720 --> 16:10.160
I'm to blame.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.920
Don't be harsh on him.

16:12.000 --> 16:12.920
Mr. He,

16:13.000 --> 16:14.600
if I get recognized by the town later,

16:14.680 --> 16:16.160
I'll give you an appreciation pennant.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.760
-Sure.
-That's right.

16:17.840 --> 16:19.400
If not for my dad,

16:19.480 --> 16:21.080
I would've run away from home long ago.

16:22.080 --> 16:23.160
Fine.

16:23.240 --> 16:24.280
Your dad is the best.

16:24.360 --> 16:26.040
I'm the only bad guy. Satisfied?

16:26.120 --> 16:27.480
Not really.

16:28.680 --> 16:29.720
He Zhangyue,

16:29.800 --> 16:31.680
let me use the rest on you.

16:31.760 --> 16:32.680
I'm not using that.

16:32.760 --> 16:34.760
Don't waste it.

16:34.840 --> 16:35.760
No, I mean it.

16:35.840 --> 16:37.560
-Hurry up and use it.
-Keep it for yourself.

16:37.640 --> 16:38.680
-Let me do it.
-Seriously?

16:38.760 --> 16:40.080
-Of course.
-No.

16:40.160 --> 16:41.480
This is so scary.

16:41.560 --> 16:43.440
He Zhangyue, stand right there!

16:43.520 --> 16:45.080
-I'm flying the kite. No way.
-Come here.

16:45.160 --> 16:47.120
-Why are you running? Stand still!
-No!

16:48.000 --> 16:48.840
Hurry.

16:48.920 --> 16:50.200
It got into my eye.

16:50.280 --> 16:51.320
It's fine.

16:51.400 --> 16:52.560
Jeez, your aged skin.

16:52.640 --> 16:54.240
It got into my eye! It hurts!

16:54.320 --> 16:55.640
-Help!
-Put it on!

16:55.720 --> 16:57.000
It hurts!

17:00.840 --> 17:02.520
Here are two free chicken wings for you.

17:02.600 --> 17:03.760
It's a new flavor.

17:03.840 --> 17:05.240
Please try it.

17:05.319 --> 17:06.400
That's great.

17:06.480 --> 17:07.680
Thank you, Ms. Liao.

17:08.280 --> 17:09.240
Your daughter

17:09.319 --> 17:10.880
is so amazing.

17:10.960 --> 17:11.960
It's nothing.

17:12.040 --> 17:13.520
I want a chicken.

17:13.599 --> 17:14.720
Please give me free wings.

17:14.800 --> 17:16.240
No problem.

17:16.319 --> 17:17.880
Your daughter is so capable.

17:17.960 --> 17:19.359
Yanggou Village finally gets a break

17:19.440 --> 17:21.480
after so many years.

17:21.560 --> 17:22.400
Exactly.

17:22.480 --> 17:24.000
They've found a distribution channel

17:24.079 --> 17:25.240
for three consecutive years.

17:25.319 --> 17:26.880
Young people

17:26.960 --> 17:28.480
are educated and well-connected.

17:29.040 --> 17:30.840
Don't praise her too much.

17:30.920 --> 17:31.800
You flatter her.

17:31.880 --> 17:33.440
Next, let's replay

17:33.520 --> 17:36.240
the appreciation letter
from the Yanggou Village committee

17:36.320 --> 17:37.640
to Zhuang Jie.

17:37.720 --> 17:39.720
Listen, they are
praising your daughter again.

17:39.800 --> 17:41.400
Why is it playing on a loop?

17:41.480 --> 17:42.720
Gosh, it's embarrassing.

17:42.800 --> 17:43.920
She is excellent.

17:45.120 --> 17:46.760
Everyone here gets a share.

17:46.840 --> 17:47.840
No matter what you buy,

17:47.920 --> 17:49.440
Liaogen Chicken will give you

17:49.520 --> 17:50.600
two free chicken wings.

17:50.680 --> 17:51.640
You see,

17:51.720 --> 17:52.880
she is giving out free wings!

17:54.520 --> 17:56.400
I'm going home.

17:56.480 --> 17:59.000
Thank you. Good job. Bye.

17:59.080 --> 18:00.200
Bye.

18:02.200 --> 18:03.200
Mrs. Chen?

18:04.280 --> 18:05.560
What are you doing here?

18:05.640 --> 18:06.600
I'm waiting for you.

18:06.680 --> 18:08.640
Me? Anything I can help with?

18:08.720 --> 18:11.400
I want to buy the town's hero a meal.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.800
I wonder if you would do me the honor.

18:13.880 --> 18:14.920
You flatter me.

18:15.000 --> 18:16.840
Are you coming or not?

18:16.920 --> 18:18.160
I'm not quite good at cooking,

18:18.240 --> 18:20.040
but I make the most delicious desserts.

18:20.120 --> 18:21.760
-I'm down.
-I knew it.

18:21.840 --> 18:23.880
You are the best.

18:25.120 --> 18:28.960
I have been eating alone for days.

18:30.160 --> 18:31.120
Where is Chen Maidong?

18:31.840 --> 18:33.520
He went to the city to help out.

18:33.600 --> 18:34.520
It has been a few days.

18:34.600 --> 18:36.280
He didn't say when he would be back.

18:37.320 --> 18:39.480
Anyway, it doesn't matter
whether he is here or not.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.840
I have recorded

18:40.920 --> 18:43.040
your glorious contributions

18:43.120 --> 18:45.760
and sent them to him on WeChat.

18:45.840 --> 18:48.160
I want this brat to learn from you.

18:48.240 --> 18:49.240
Mrs. Chen, don't tease me.

18:49.320 --> 18:51.520
He is mentioned
on the broadcast far more than I am.

18:51.600 --> 18:53.040
It's useless though.

18:53.120 --> 18:55.320
That brat never listens to me.

18:56.040 --> 18:58.440
How about this? Go home first.
I'll come after my deliveries.

18:58.520 --> 18:59.640
It's sunny out here.

18:59.720 --> 19:01.000
All right. I will wait for you.

19:01.080 --> 19:01.920
Watch out for cars.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.840
It's not just anyone who gets praised

19:17.920 --> 19:19.200
on the broadcast.

19:19.280 --> 19:22.240
You two are equally outstanding.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.200
What a perfect match.

19:23.280 --> 19:24.680
Mrs. Chen, please give me a break.

19:24.760 --> 19:26.040
Let's look at the photos.

19:26.120 --> 19:27.240
When was this?

19:27.320 --> 19:28.640
I remember he wasn't like this

19:28.720 --> 19:29.920
in Grades 10 and 11.

19:30.600 --> 19:33.160
It was when he was in Grade 12.

19:33.240 --> 19:34.400
He just went wild.

19:35.560 --> 19:36.840
He had a good-looking face

19:36.920 --> 19:38.400
but the wrong hairstyle.

19:38.480 --> 19:40.400
He may look decent and honest now,

19:40.480 --> 19:42.880
but he was difficult back then.

19:42.960 --> 19:45.600
His grandpa and I were so worried.

19:45.680 --> 19:48.400
That's normal. My mom also says
I was an annoying teenage girl.

19:48.480 --> 19:49.680
When Maidong was little,

19:49.760 --> 19:51.000
the whole family doted on him.

19:51.680 --> 19:53.200
He used to be mild

19:53.760 --> 19:55.920
until his parents hit some rough patches,

19:56.000 --> 19:57.240
which then provoked Maidong

19:57.320 --> 19:58.840
into being rebellious.

19:59.480 --> 20:01.680
Speaking of his parents,

20:01.760 --> 20:02.920
well…

20:05.920 --> 20:07.680
You are back. What a coincidence.

20:08.440 --> 20:09.760
As if.

20:09.840 --> 20:11.000
This is my home.

20:14.720 --> 20:15.920
Refill the water.

20:16.000 --> 20:17.400
Isn't it full already?

20:18.120 --> 20:19.480
Just do what I say.

20:36.840 --> 20:38.400
Come.

20:39.800 --> 20:40.640
Sit.

20:50.080 --> 20:51.280
Put that down.

20:52.120 --> 20:53.280
That's rude.

21:08.080 --> 21:10.680
Maidong, Jie helped Yanggou Village

21:10.760 --> 21:13.160
promote agricultural products.

21:13.840 --> 21:15.760
She closed a three-year contract deal.

21:16.520 --> 21:18.360
You already told me.

21:18.920 --> 21:19.920
Did I?

21:21.360 --> 21:22.400
You see, I'm so forgetful.

21:22.480 --> 21:24.720
Indeed, you are.

21:24.800 --> 21:26.280
I told you I'm coming back today.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.680
But you didn't tell me
you would have a guest.

21:32.560 --> 21:35.320
Jie, drink some tea before leaving.

21:35.400 --> 21:37.280
It's time for my walk now.

21:37.360 --> 21:39.160
Ma'am, I didn't know you had this hobby.

21:40.480 --> 21:42.720
It was a crutch that helped me

21:42.800 --> 21:44.400
through Maidong's rebellious phase.

21:44.480 --> 21:46.280
Or else, I would have died long ago.

21:47.320 --> 21:48.720
I'm getting up in years.

21:48.800 --> 21:51.200
There is no hope in life

21:52.600 --> 21:54.480
if my grandson won't be braver.

21:55.400 --> 21:57.520
Not at all. You are full of energy.

21:57.600 --> 21:59.280
You will live to be 199.

21:59.880 --> 22:01.440
I'm not a monster.

22:02.360 --> 22:04.080
Ma'am, take care.

22:20.720 --> 22:21.760
What did you talk about?

22:23.360 --> 22:25.400
About why I can't stay in Nanping.

22:26.680 --> 22:28.120
Why?

22:28.680 --> 22:30.360
The life here is too slow.

22:31.280 --> 22:33.000
It doesn't suit me.
It will drive me crazy.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.440
When are you leaving?

22:36.040 --> 22:37.200
Tomorrow.

22:41.320 --> 22:42.840
Let's go. I will see you home.

22:46.560 --> 22:48.560
Is this how you treat your guests?

22:49.800 --> 22:51.560
How do you treat your guests, then?

22:52.520 --> 22:54.200
You should at least

22:54.280 --> 22:55.280
give your guests a tour

22:55.360 --> 22:56.520
on their first visit.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.600
This is the living room.

23:01.680 --> 23:03.040
That's the bedroom.

23:03.120 --> 23:05.320
The kitchen
and Grandma's room are downstairs.

23:05.400 --> 23:06.880
That's all.

23:06.960 --> 23:07.960
I have visited the kitchen

23:08.040 --> 23:09.640
and your grandma's room.

23:09.720 --> 23:11.040
Let's see yours.

23:22.120 --> 23:23.120
Classical music.

23:27.720 --> 23:29.320
Is this one of your secrets too?

23:30.120 --> 23:31.200
Zhuang Jie.

23:33.160 --> 23:34.960
Is this what you do with everyone?

23:36.360 --> 23:37.360
Chen Maidong,

23:37.440 --> 23:39.120
is this what you do to everyone?

23:40.120 --> 23:41.120
What about me?

23:41.200 --> 23:42.840
Aloof.

23:44.600 --> 23:45.800
What about me?

23:48.520 --> 23:49.680
Frivolous.

23:55.400 --> 23:57.720
Does that concern you?

24:00.360 --> 24:01.520
-Let me walk you--
-Bugger off.

24:18.640 --> 24:20.640
I shouldn't have said that. I'm sorry.

24:32.400 --> 24:34.400
I will buy you dinner as an apology.

24:49.920 --> 24:51.360
I'm ill-mannered.

24:51.440 --> 24:53.200
Don't let my stupid behavior get to you.

24:53.280 --> 24:55.640
I wish you a safe journey tomorrow.

24:59.120 --> 25:00.040
Zhang's Porridge Stall.

25:00.120 --> 25:01.560
See you there in ten minutes.

25:12.720 --> 25:14.880
Do you have to keep glaring at me?

25:14.960 --> 25:16.320
Because I'm frivolous.

25:18.520 --> 25:20.320
Do I need to apologize to you properly?

25:21.520 --> 25:23.640
Forget it. I don't hold grudges.

25:28.800 --> 25:29.880
Chen Maidong,

25:32.160 --> 25:33.800
you have a nice side profile.

25:35.440 --> 25:37.160
You sit in front of me

25:37.240 --> 25:38.680
and say I have a nice side profile.

25:38.760 --> 25:40.560
Isn't that not very convincing?

25:45.120 --> 25:46.520
Who did you get my number from?

25:46.600 --> 25:48.000
Your grandma?

25:48.080 --> 25:48.960
Madam Wu.

25:50.520 --> 25:52.160
Order anything. I will pay.

25:52.240 --> 25:55.720
ZHANG'S PORRIDGE STALL

25:55.800 --> 25:56.720
Excuse me.

25:56.800 --> 25:58.560
I would like two orders
of vegetable congee

25:58.640 --> 26:00.320
and one order of beef dumplings,

26:01.600 --> 26:03.200
And a vegetable salad. Thank you.

26:03.280 --> 26:04.400
That's light.

26:05.520 --> 26:07.360
-Not drinking?
-Will you drink with me?

26:07.440 --> 26:08.920
I can't.

26:09.520 --> 26:11.840
But I thought the top salesperson
could hold their liquor quite well.

26:12.640 --> 26:14.920
You have so many stereotypes about me.

26:17.520 --> 26:18.800
Did I say something wrong again?

26:18.880 --> 26:21.440
No, I am a good drinker.

26:21.520 --> 26:23.120
But I'm not drinking now.

26:24.040 --> 26:26.320
I had my gallbladder removed
not long ago. I'm recuperating.

26:26.880 --> 26:28.280
But it seems to me

26:28.920 --> 26:31.120
that you haven't been resting lately.

26:31.960 --> 26:33.960
I didn't dare to tell my mom about that.

26:35.000 --> 26:37.280
I was forced to do the food deliveries.

26:37.360 --> 26:38.840
I have to swallow my pain.

26:41.920 --> 26:42.880
Chen Maidong,

26:43.560 --> 26:45.120
so you do smile.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.720
Why do you rarely smile?

26:48.920 --> 26:50.240
It's because of my job.

26:50.320 --> 26:51.760
I have to keep my emotions in check.

26:52.360 --> 26:53.560
Over time, it became a habit.

26:54.680 --> 26:57.160
I don't join in
whenever there is an exciting crowd.

26:57.240 --> 26:58.160
I might not be welcome.

26:58.720 --> 27:00.600
Do you also not drink because of your job?

27:00.680 --> 27:01.560
Right.

27:01.640 --> 27:03.520
I require myself
to be on call 24 hours a day

27:03.600 --> 27:04.840
and to always stay sober.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.360
If anything were to happen,

27:06.440 --> 27:08.240
I can't go to work reeking of alcohol.

27:09.800 --> 27:11.320
Your profession is very noble.

27:14.200 --> 27:15.880
It's the same for every profession.

27:19.160 --> 27:21.280
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

27:33.200 --> 27:34.080
Chen Maidong,

27:36.320 --> 27:38.680
have you ever seen a ghost while working?

27:39.600 --> 27:40.840
You are always so facetious.

27:40.920 --> 27:42.560
I'm asking seriously.

27:42.640 --> 27:43.640
I believe in science.

27:44.440 --> 27:46.840
Still, I also believe in phenomena
that science can't explain.

27:46.920 --> 27:47.960
Me too.

27:48.840 --> 27:50.720
We should have a sense of reverence.

27:52.040 --> 27:53.880
Have you ever encountered
any supernatural events?

27:56.640 --> 27:58.040
A few days ago,

27:58.120 --> 28:00.040
we went to pick up a deceased man.

28:01.160 --> 28:02.720
His son believed

28:02.800 --> 28:04.280
that if he placed a basin of water

28:04.360 --> 28:05.520
in the house at noon,

28:05.600 --> 28:07.520
the reflection of the sunlight on the wall

28:07.600 --> 28:09.120
would show his dad's soul.

28:10.160 --> 28:12.240
So we had to wait with him.

28:13.280 --> 28:14.400
What happened then?

28:15.320 --> 28:16.680
Then…

28:20.480 --> 28:21.320
I need their help.

28:21.400 --> 28:23.160
On the count of three, open the curtains.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.160
Be fast, okay?

28:24.240 --> 28:25.120
One,

28:25.200 --> 28:26.360
two,

28:27.360 --> 28:28.360
three.

28:31.720 --> 28:33.560
All my colleagues talked about it later.

28:33.640 --> 28:35.880
They said the wall and the basin

28:35.960 --> 28:37.120
didn't show anything.

28:37.840 --> 28:39.200
That guy was probably lying.

28:40.560 --> 28:41.560
What about you?

28:45.240 --> 28:46.680
I didn't look at anything.

28:47.640 --> 28:49.920
Because the guy was too excited
when he stood up.

28:51.040 --> 28:52.080
He stepped on my foot.

28:55.480 --> 28:57.000
I was busy pulling my foot away.

29:12.520 --> 29:13.760
I forgot to tell you.

29:15.000 --> 29:16.240
I don't like beef.

29:17.080 --> 29:18.560
This is pork.

29:18.640 --> 29:20.120
Do you think I'm stupid?

29:25.360 --> 29:26.320
Chen Maidong,

29:26.400 --> 29:29.120
now you know I'm not just a bragger.

29:29.200 --> 29:31.000
Yes, the entire town knows that.

29:31.800 --> 29:34.120
Were these lampposts installed afterward?

29:34.640 --> 29:36.480
This area didn't use to be so bright.

29:37.480 --> 29:40.040
I remember you were reserved back then.

29:40.120 --> 29:41.520
Why are you so talkative now?

29:42.240 --> 29:43.240
My mom always complains

29:43.320 --> 29:44.800
that I'm louder than a zoo.

29:45.440 --> 29:46.800
No one really remembers

29:46.880 --> 29:48.120
what they were like as a kid.

29:48.200 --> 29:50.080
People change.

29:51.000 --> 29:53.120
No one could have expected

29:53.200 --> 29:54.600
a high school bully like you

29:54.680 --> 29:56.280
to turn out like you have now.

29:56.360 --> 29:58.040
I wasn't a bully.

29:58.120 --> 29:59.560
That's not true.

30:00.400 --> 30:01.720
Sure, it's a rumor.

30:01.800 --> 30:04.360
It is. I never messed with anyone
without provocation.

30:04.440 --> 30:06.560
Once they provoked you,
it was a stand-up fight.

30:08.800 --> 30:09.880
You! What?

30:09.960 --> 30:12.000
Are you trying
to bully a disabled girl again?

30:12.800 --> 30:14.240
I told you

30:14.920 --> 30:16.680
not to keep mentioning
that you are disabled.

30:16.760 --> 30:18.360
Then no one would see you as one.

30:20.360 --> 30:21.720
You have a good memory.

30:24.360 --> 30:25.480
Chen Maidong,

30:26.520 --> 30:27.800
you haven't

30:28.400 --> 30:29.600
changed much

30:30.400 --> 30:31.640
from what I remember.

30:32.480 --> 30:34.120
You get sidetracked sometimes,

30:34.200 --> 30:36.200
but you are always on the right path.

30:37.800 --> 30:38.880
Therefore,

30:40.320 --> 30:43.000
don't let others' opinions hold you back.

30:43.560 --> 30:45.280
Don't lower your standards for a partner

30:45.360 --> 30:46.920
just because of your job.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.840
People who understand you

30:48.920 --> 30:50.960
will embrace everything about you.

30:51.520 --> 30:52.480
People who don't

30:52.560 --> 30:54.760
will never accept you,
even if you change yourself.

30:56.760 --> 30:58.560
Are you speaking from experience?

30:58.640 --> 30:59.960
Exactly.

31:00.040 --> 31:02.240
I'm giving you honest advice

31:02.320 --> 31:03.520
as a disabled girl.

31:03.600 --> 31:04.560
You have to take it.

31:05.720 --> 31:06.960
Why are you single, then?

31:07.720 --> 31:08.720
Me?

31:09.680 --> 31:12.480
Mine is an unrequited love.

31:16.760 --> 31:19.160
Someone just told me the other day

31:19.240 --> 31:20.880
that I am her ideal man.

31:23.240 --> 31:25.640
Ideals are fantasies,

31:25.720 --> 31:27.720
while reality is the end of fantasies.

31:36.160 --> 31:37.360
This is my place.

31:38.880 --> 31:40.840
Thank you for walking me home.

31:42.360 --> 31:43.720
Go inside.

31:45.560 --> 31:46.920
Shouldn't we exchange contacts?

31:47.000 --> 31:48.880
You didn't leave your phone
at work, did you?

32:02.640 --> 32:04.920
SET REMARK AND TAG

32:06.600 --> 32:08.440
SET REMARK AND TAG, REMARK: GREAT MAN

32:08.520 --> 32:09.680
There.

32:15.080 --> 32:16.760
Aren't you going to set one for me?

32:20.840 --> 32:22.640
Can't I even touch you?

32:22.720 --> 32:23.600
Are you gilded with gold?

32:23.680 --> 32:25.160
It's a force of habit.

32:25.840 --> 32:27.880
Most people don't want
physical contact with us.

32:31.400 --> 32:32.360
Chen Maidong,

32:33.240 --> 32:34.280
I'm leaving.

32:35.360 --> 32:37.760
See you again next time I'm in Nanping.

32:42.760 --> 32:44.120
We don't shake hands

32:45.080 --> 32:46.160
or say, "See you again."

32:47.240 --> 32:48.440
So,

32:49.200 --> 32:50.520
I wish you a safe journey.

32:56.680 --> 32:58.360
Don't do that with me.

32:59.080 --> 33:00.000
Chen Maidong.

33:02.960 --> 33:04.520
See you again.

33:07.160 --> 33:08.000
Zhuang Jie.

33:17.080 --> 33:18.680
Does your unrequited love

33:19.880 --> 33:20.920
mind

33:21.600 --> 33:22.960
your leg?

33:23.720 --> 33:24.920
Not entirely.

33:25.880 --> 33:28.680
Maybe it's because he loves himself

33:28.760 --> 33:30.160
more than he loves me.

33:30.240 --> 33:31.880
I understand, honestly.

33:31.960 --> 33:33.120
Because deep down,

33:33.200 --> 33:34.640
we are the same.

33:34.720 --> 33:36.520
It's normal that we couldn't be together.

34:24.520 --> 34:27.560
NANPING GUOGUANG HIGH SCHOOL,
NANPING INQUIRY-BASED PILOT SCHOOL

34:29.400 --> 34:30.760
Chen Maidong,

34:30.840 --> 34:33.000
you never stay out of fights
for more than a few days.

34:33.080 --> 34:35.199
Aren't your grandparents
worried enough about you?

34:36.960 --> 34:38.199
Don't call them again.

34:39.040 --> 34:40.480
Who should I call, then?

34:40.560 --> 34:41.719
Your parents?

34:42.199 --> 34:44.040
I did call them.

34:44.120 --> 34:46.159
One doesn't answer,
while the other says they're busy.

34:46.239 --> 34:47.239
Besides your grandparents,

34:47.320 --> 34:49.880
you have no other guardian, all right?

34:49.960 --> 34:51.880
You scored high
on the junior high academic test.

34:51.960 --> 34:53.199
Can't you work harder?

34:53.840 --> 34:55.199
Does fighting solve your problem?

34:55.280 --> 34:57.440
You should ask them if being mean

34:57.520 --> 34:59.120
solves their problems.

35:00.120 --> 35:02.560
You don't want your grandparents
to come again, do you?

35:04.000 --> 35:05.000
No.

35:06.960 --> 35:08.440
If so, make up for your mistakes.

35:09.080 --> 35:10.200
Your classmate, Zhuang Jie,

35:10.280 --> 35:11.400
has difficulty walking,

35:11.480 --> 35:12.440
especially on rainy days

35:12.520 --> 35:14.160
when her parents have to pick her up.

35:14.240 --> 35:15.440
Starting today,

35:15.520 --> 35:16.840
you will help her.

35:16.920 --> 35:17.760
Whenever it rains,

35:17.840 --> 35:19.720
take her to the school gate

35:19.800 --> 35:22.080
and watch her get in the car
before you leave.

35:28.800 --> 35:29.840
I don't want to.

35:30.520 --> 35:32.480
I have played a tree with her.
I owe her nothing.

35:33.920 --> 35:35.200
Chen Maidong,

35:35.280 --> 35:38.440
I'm giving you a chance
to prove that you aren't a lost cause.

35:38.520 --> 35:40.840
If you dare to leave Zhuang Jie behind
even for a day,

35:40.920 --> 35:42.440
you might as well drop out of school.

35:58.040 --> 35:59.080
Chen Maidong,

35:59.160 --> 36:00.400
do you remember the days

36:00.480 --> 36:01.920
when you carried me on your back?

36:02.640 --> 36:04.320
It was a rainy day,

36:04.400 --> 36:06.560
and I waited for you
outside the classroom building.

36:07.520 --> 36:09.440
But someone told me that your mom came.

36:09.520 --> 36:11.360
You bolted out without leaving a word.

36:11.440 --> 36:13.040
People were coming and going around me.

36:13.120 --> 36:15.640
I didn't have an umbrella
and was so helpless.

36:15.720 --> 36:18.320
I was sure you wouldn't come back.

36:19.440 --> 36:20.760
It was your mom after all.

36:21.520 --> 36:22.760
To my surprise,

36:23.840 --> 36:25.320
you did come back.

36:26.120 --> 36:28.000
From then on, I knew

36:28.080 --> 36:29.880
Chen Maidong was a trustworthy person.

36:29.960 --> 36:32.200
At least you're not
like what others think.

36:33.240 --> 36:34.520
Do you still remember this?

36:35.160 --> 36:36.720
I forgot.

36:39.200 --> 36:41.360
I also knew that you were acting out

36:41.440 --> 36:43.320
because you wanted your mom to come back

36:43.400 --> 36:44.640
to see you more

36:44.720 --> 36:45.880
and to look after you.

36:47.240 --> 36:48.720
Stop analyzing.

38:31.760 --> 38:33.560
Zhuang Jie is going back
to Shanghai tomorrow.

38:45.200 --> 38:46.600
I told you.

38:48.120 --> 38:50.280
We can't put hope
on some people and things.

38:51.880 --> 38:53.040
Those who are meant to leave

38:54.800 --> 38:56.040
will eventually leave.

39:20.360 --> 39:21.640
LA DILETTANTE

39:21.720 --> 39:23.520
I AM LA DILETTANTE

39:23.600 --> 39:25.520
MOMENTS

39:27.040 --> 39:29.840
APRIL 30TH: THE WEATHER WAS VERY GOOD
WHEN WE PARTED

39:34.160 --> 39:35.280
COPY

39:38.600 --> 39:40.280
LA DILETTANTE

39:40.360 --> 39:41.240
OLD CEDAR

39:43.720 --> 39:45.960
OLD CEDAR

39:46.480 --> 39:49.200
Maidong, always remember this.

39:49.280 --> 39:51.920
Only kids who cry get candy.

39:52.000 --> 39:54.960
Those who are leaving
fear they may remain too long.

40:07.040 --> 40:09.080
-Jie!
-She will be back soon.

40:09.160 --> 40:10.640
-Why are you crying?
-Don't leave, Jie!

40:10.720 --> 40:12.040
-Jie!
-Behave yourself.

40:12.120 --> 40:13.320
Where is my feather duster?

40:13.400 --> 40:14.400
Gosh, no!

40:14.480 --> 40:16.280
-Jie, help me! Help!
-Come here.

40:16.360 --> 40:18.840
Niaoniao, calm down.
I will call you once I reach Shanghai.

40:18.920 --> 40:20.400
Keep Yan's goose safe.

40:20.480 --> 40:22.800
Jie, don't go!

40:22.880 --> 40:24.520
Please take me with you!

40:24.600 --> 40:25.600
I miss you.

40:25.680 --> 40:27.600
Enough! Stop being dramatic!

40:28.360 --> 40:31.440
-Stop crying or I will beat you.
-No!

40:31.520 --> 40:32.360
-Jie!
-Go now.

40:32.440 --> 40:33.960
-Mom.
-Jie!

40:34.040 --> 40:35.960
I'm going to beat you.

40:36.040 --> 40:37.720
-That hurts!
-Stop!

40:37.800 --> 40:39.000
You're such a mischievous girl.

40:40.040 --> 40:41.000
Mr. He.

40:41.840 --> 40:43.000
Let me.

40:43.080 --> 40:44.000
Get in the car.

40:44.080 --> 40:44.920
All right.

40:49.000 --> 40:50.000
Careful.

40:52.640 --> 40:53.920
Mr. He,

40:54.000 --> 40:56.200
is Mom really going to beat He Niaoniao?

40:56.280 --> 40:57.480
Don't worry.

40:57.560 --> 40:58.880
She knows what she is doing.

40:58.960 --> 41:00.920
On top of that, He Niaoniao is smart.

41:01.000 --> 41:02.600
She knows when to keep quiet.

41:03.240 --> 41:04.640
Mr. He, it has been tough for you.

41:04.720 --> 41:06.520
This family is lucky to have you.

41:08.120 --> 41:09.280
On the contrary,

41:10.080 --> 41:11.280
I'm lucky

41:12.000 --> 41:13.120
to have you guys.

41:15.680 --> 41:16.880
Let's go!

41:16.960 --> 41:18.040
All right!

41:40.520 --> 41:41.720
Chen Maidong?

41:42.880 --> 41:44.640
Chen Maidong.

41:44.720 --> 41:46.240
Not so loud.

41:47.920 --> 41:49.400
What a coincidence.

41:49.480 --> 41:50.840
I came to see someone off.

41:50.920 --> 41:52.240
Me?

41:52.320 --> 41:53.720
What a narcissist you are.

42:15.440 --> 42:17.440
Ask someone to help you when you get off.

42:17.520 --> 42:18.360
Don't force yourself.

42:19.280 --> 42:20.800
Are you worrying about me?

42:22.200 --> 42:23.120
I should get going.

42:24.520 --> 42:25.640
Anything else?

42:31.360 --> 42:32.920
I told you

42:33.000 --> 42:34.400
that you have a nice side profile.

42:36.560 --> 42:37.800
That's too much.

42:43.640 --> 42:44.680
Chen Maidong.

42:53.440 --> 42:55.480
You came here for me, right?

42:57.240 --> 42:58.320
Does it make a difference?

42:58.400 --> 42:59.680
Of course it does.

43:00.720 --> 43:01.920
What is it supposed to mean?

43:04.400 --> 43:05.800
I'm not sure yet.

45:53.240 --> 45:59.320
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
